{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前網上流傳影片，見到一輛私家車在銅鑼灣SOGO對出行駛期間，突然剷上行人路行駛，幸好沒有造成傷亡。</p><p>涉事左軚電動車掛有內地車牌及本港FU字頭車牌。</p><p>警方今日（29日）指，早前已鎖定車輛及司機身分，會依法向涉案司機作出檢控。</p><p>案件暫列作「不小心駕駛」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:21:25.555072+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:08:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.862890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.862890+00:00","content_hash":"239109fc32e9a1cc57c1bcd66582f6dc1bd717bdb3a58e44a532e2721e761a50","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}